  "method": "REAL walk-forward backtest. For each documented crisis event (real date), slice the actual FRED DCOILBRENTEU daily observations ending on/before the event date (last 200) as pre-event context, forecast the next 30 trading days with the Chronos+TimesFM+TabPFN ensemble, and compare BOTH the ensemble and each individual member to the REAL realized Brent prices over that window (the observations that actually followed). Metrics: MAPE (mean abs % error) and within-+/-10% hit-rate. TabPFN is trained leave-one-out so the event under test never trains on its own documented outcome (no label leakage). History and ground truth are both real FRED data; nothing is synthesized."
